<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces continued to intercept and destroy explosive-laden drones in Kirkuk while a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq’s stance on the Iran blockade. Iraqi officials met with Trump to discuss regional security and reaffirmed that Iraq will not be used to attack neighboring countries. A security guard was killed and three people injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk. Turkey backed Iraqi counter-ISIS efforts in Kirkuk and welcomed reinforcement of border posts. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOU25zaFI0aWktYXNiZFZpRU9hM01selNVMUJFWlZ5V20xc1JBaG9fekp4emN0bFBiQTA3Y3NYV25JeEJQN3FGT1FlbFB5UTBURXp6eDZOTmpHSTNrdG9VTnRxU3VuX05nSGdwbFBmV2lTOEtHQWJaUUROWk5WU1YyRWFSbWpqNERYZUdyZmJwVzFiZl90bzVEVTZDd09vdVlUWGdVZ2RSQzlHUTBnMVVjM19haHgzMUdPQ19LZFNETThRUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOUDJMSWFMSXNtMGJLZk9PVGtWZlJnLV9QbWJIc3M1R0twWnZLcEJ0al84SW1qOWJ3M1ZkbF9iX2l1TWlBdXYzUUZRdzlhUGNkVmExbTF4Q1NRd1d0V2VtRzNmc05jc0J2bk5uLVB2cF82VUFqUTJYUHpobEFteE8xV2hJczNrTlUtYW1hUENpYWZpckJkMGNlcmtCdXZoMkc5MkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;IraqiNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOb2xweXZBT0Q5Z3VqNnR6amoyUnA2bDJjc0xLRTJoYlJ0anVGY3ZLazJ6aXN6SVRvVmZGcUMydTRTZ3EweGhYWlZWaklsRElVVGxNZG1ueUpjSVFRZE5oU3BRdXl0WHJPOU5OY1VHOGk5TXo2aFdrZjZDYjVReE9EZWpYdVhHejFrR0t5T1FrX2JZei0xM1pGWjBBclN4eWpyWVE0RjZfYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WION&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPMVRCbDlmZXRUY0dpZHNFRHl6VWstYjgxWXdSZHltQlhYdURQZ